---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Gutter Installation',
  provider: { '@type': 'GeneralContractor', '@id': 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/#business', name: 'Purpose Construction', url: 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'State', name: 'Texas', containedInPlace: { '@type': 'Country', name: 'United States' } },
  description: 'Gutter installation across East Texas: seamless aluminum and steel gutters with downspouts, gutter guards and the right slope to drain water away from East Texas homes.',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Gutter Installation in Lufkin, TX | Purpose Construction"
  description="Gutter installation in Lufkin, TX: seamless gutters, downspouts and gutter guards sized for East Texas rain. Free estimates: (936) 255-2235."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Services', href: '/services/' }, { label: 'Exterior Services', href: '/exterior-services/' }, { label: 'Gutter Installation', href: '/gutter-installation/' }]} />
  <PageHero title="Gutter Installation in Lufkin, TX" subtitle="Seamless aluminum and steel gutters hung with the right slope, well-placed downspouts and gutter guards to keep heavy East Texas rain away from your foundation." tag="Exterior Service" 
    image="/images/gutter-installation-lufkin-tx.jpg"
  />

  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-50">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <SectionHeading tag="Gutter Installation" title="Managing East Texas Rainfall Starts at the Roofline" />
          <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">
            <p>Lufkin gets some of the highest average rainfall in Texas, and heavy downpours often dump inches of water in a short time. If your gutters aren't sized and sloped to carry that water away, every hard rain washes out soil around the foundation, puts water in crawl spaces and basements, and tears up your landscaping. Purpose Construction installs seamless gutters sized and set up for the heavy rains common across Angelina County.</p>
            <p>Seamless aluminum gutters are formed on-site in one continuous run, so there are no seams to leak and fail like sectional gutters do. We hang them with enough slope to drain fast, but not so much that water rushes past the downspout and over the edge. We place downspouts to carry water away from the foundation instead of dumping it at another spot along the house.</p>
            <p>East Texas pines drop a lot of needles, cones and small branches, and they fill gutters fast. Our gutter guards keep that out and let water through, so homeowners in the Piney Woods spend less time cleaning gutters.</p>
            <p>Gutters and roofs work as one system. If your roof edge or shingles need attention along with new gutters, our sister company Purpose Roofing handles <a href="https://purpose-roofing.com/gutters/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-semibold text-brand-red hover:text-brand-red-dark transition-colors duration-150">gutters and roof work in Lufkin</a> and across East Texas.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
            <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
            <a href="/exterior-services/" class="btn-outline">All Exterior Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/gutter-installation-lufkin-tx-800.webp" alt="Gutter installation across East Texas by Purpose Construction" class="rounded-xl shadow-hero" width="640" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="What's Included" title="Gutter Installation Services" align="center" />
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {['Seamless Aluminum Gutters', 'Steel Gutters', 'Downspouts', 'Gutter Guards', 'Fascia Mounting', 'Proper Slope & Drainage', 'Custom Colors'].map(item => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>{item}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding-sm bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Related Services" title="Related Exterior Services" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[{ label: 'Siding Installation', href: '/siding-installation/' }, { label: 'Exterior Services', href: '/exterior-services/' }].map(link => (
          <a href={link.href} class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-charcoal-900 transition-all duration-200">{link.label} →</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-red">
    <div class="container-mid px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="display-md text-white mb-4">Protect Your Home From the Rain</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-base text-white/80">Contact Purpose Construction for a free gutter installation estimate. We serve Lufkin and all of East Texas.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost px-8 py-4">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:9362552235" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
